{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47259","headline":"言志献浙东廉访辞召 · 徐灵府","name":"言志献浙东廉访辞召","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野性歌三乐，皇恩出九重。\n那烦紫宸命，远下白云峰。\n多媿书传鹤，深惭纸画龙。\n将何佐明主，甘老在岩松。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"徐灵府","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47259.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47259","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}